Magic resistance provides complete safety from magic missiles, striking, 
destroy armor attacks, finger of death (used by high level 
spellmonsters, different from the player spell), polymorph traps, 
anti-magic traps, teleport and levelport traps.  It doesn't protect vs 
elemental beam attacks, or gaze attacks.  It is conferred by wearing 
cloaks of magic resistance, gray dragon scales/scale mail, wielding 
Magicbane, carrying the Eye of the Aethiopica, the Orb of Detection, 
the Platinum Yendorian Express Card, the Eyes of the Overworld, the 
Scepter of Might, or carrying the Magic Mirror of Merlin.

Reflection provides immunity from beam attacks of all types, and 
reflects floating eye's gaze and Medusa's gaze back at them.  Oddly 
enough, pyrolisks' gazes *aren't* reflected.  Lightning still causes 
blindness, and wide angle disintegration attacks from irate deities 
still make it through.  Reflection can be acquired from silver dragon 
scales/scale mail, amulets of reflection, shields of reflection, or 
wielding the Longbow of Diana.

